# Technical docs maintenance

- Every flow must keep a Mermaid dependency graph in sync with real imports/routes.
- Decision files use Status / Context / Decision / Consequences / Owners.
- Prefer editing existing hubs over creating parallel docs; link instead of duplicating PDFs.
- When adding a DEC-*, add a row to `knowledge/decisions/INDEX.md`.
- When adding a module or primary file, update `knowledge/REGISTRY.md`.
